Short    : free4all registered sourcecode to Offline program!
Author   : chris@aio.co.uk  (Chris Seward)
Uploader : chris@aio.co.uk  (Chris Seward)
Type     : Dev/Amos

Offline Registered version free4all!

As I rarely use Amos anymore i've decided to give away the registered
version of Offline source code for use in Amos.

You can compile it and use it, take bits out and use them in your
own software but you CAN NOT just put your name in and claim it is
yours.

This program was from 1997. Released freely 28/08/99

Have fun!

Chris Seward
amiga@thefree.net


